## The structural theorem (why the census is exact, not empirical)

The lawfulness condition is EXACTLY AFFINE in t: the constraint
evaluates to A + tB where **A is the sector trace**. So lawful means
A = -tB, and all 1,296 configurations partition exactly: **6 lawful
at every t** (and these six ARE the Cycle-320 landed family — so
everything the ladder says about the landed family is t-independent
by construction), 84 lawful only at t = 0, 60 at a single computed
onset root, 1,146 never.

